============================================================
29. SUCCESS CRITERIA
============================================================

The solution is successful only when:

1. Every calculated amount is traceable to individual source accounts.
2. Every account is mapped, excluded, split by rule, or reported as unresolved.
3. Parent and detail rows are not double counted.
4. Units are converted exactly once.
5. Contra accounts receive their correct economic presentation.
6. OFF BS accounts do not enter primary BS totals.
7. Bank asset and liability balances are not incorrectly netted.
8. Fixed assets reconcile gross cost to net carrying value.
9. Schedules tie independently to the TB and main statement.
10. Raw variances are never overwritten.
11. Precision differences remain visible.
12. Mapping suggestions remain provisional until approved.
13. The Dataiku WebApp backend remains lightweight.
14. Core library tests run outside Dataiku.
15. A completed result can be exported without rerunning the reconciliation.
16. New countries can be supported mainly through configuration and mapping updates.
